    "profile_text": {
        "body": "PegaSystems Inc is a public company headquartered in Waltham, Massachusetts, traded under the ticker PEGA, and it operates the website pega.com. On its own site the company describes itself as a leading AI-powered platform for enterprise transformation, saying that large organizations use it to automate workflows, personalize customer experiences, and modernize legacy systems. It states that it has served the world's largest organizations since 1983.\n\nThe site presents AI as central to the offering. It describes Infinity 26 as the company's latest platform release, intended to help enterprises build, orchestrate, and scale AI with predictability, control, and measurable value. It says its AI agents operate with context, compliance, and human oversight, and that Pega Platform unifies AI for mission-critical work. Pega Blueprint is described as an AI-powered workspace that brings business and IT together with governance so that design-time work moves into production.\n\nBeyond the company's own description, its record shows litigation exposure in Massachusetts, where 97 cases are counted. No products are tracked for the company in the reference data, and no MCP servers are listed.",
